# armour/tiles/studs: studs on the leather bracer (F, with the `studs` ornament): a metal-2 rivet on a
# 3 px grid, at the leather's own step (the shadow side's studs fall darker by themselves).
# Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h; `on-region` is P2C_CONTRACTS 4 (the regions after the word).
use person
body adult
role overlay studs
tags tile overlay
on-region F

view D key rest origin 0 0
|...
|.O.
|...

